This package is an independent Haskell implementation of the Common
Expression Language (CEL) that reproduces the observable behaviour of the
third-party software below. No source code from these projects is included;
their behaviour was recorded by the scripts in test/ and bench/, which run
them from the pinned upstream Petrus virtual environment.

